  "notes": "Draft: moe.gov.ly is suspended, so archived ministry pages were used. They confirm the 9-year basic stage (grade 1 of basic education; الصف السابع; the preparatory/basic-completion certificate) and a 3-year secondary stage, whose years the ministry calls السنة الأولى–الثالثة بمرحلة التعليم الثانوي, ending with a certificate with scientific and literary sections. The الصف الأول–الثالث الثانوي names used here are not confirmed by an official source."
